Local changes to the vendored Hunyuan3D-Omni (upstream https://github.com/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hunyuan3D-Omni,
commit 4d47c0c). Only License.txt, Notice.txt, README.md, requirements.txt and the `hy3dshape` package were vendored,
the package renamed to `hy3domni` (every `hy3dshape` import rewritten) so it can sit next to Hunyuan3D-2.1's own
`hy3dshape` in the worker. This patch is relative to that renamed copy.

diff --git a/hy3domni/models/utils/misc.py b/hy3domni/models/utils/misc.py
index e6b0221..01efa1d 100755
--- a/hy3domni/models/utils/misc.py
+++ b/hy3domni/models/utils/misc.py
@@ -24,6 +24,9 @@ def get_config_from_file(config_file: str) -> Union[DictConfig, ListConfig]:
 
 
 def get_obj_from_str(string, reload=False):
+    # Vendored as `hy3domni` (next to Hunyuan3D-2.1's own `hy3dshape`): the weights' configs still name `hy3dshape`.
+    if string.startswith("hy3dshape."):
+        string = "hy3domni." + string[len("hy3dshape."):]
     module, cls = string.rsplit(".", 1)
     if reload:
         module_imp = importlib.import_module(module)
